     1,
     "Hi Laia,<div><br></div><div>Can you try:</div><div><br></div><div>- Move your structure executable to a path without spaces and without special characters such as &quot;(&quot; .</div><div>- If your computer is a PC running on Windows use: exec = ~/structure.exe , where ~ is the path to your structure executable.</div><div>- Make sure that you downloaded the correct executable for your operating system and that is the version without front end.</div><div>- After downloading the executable open it (double click) to grant access manually and to make sure it runs.</div><div>- Make sure that individual and population names do not have spaces and that they are unique. </div><div><br></div><div>Please let us know if that worked.</div><div><br></div><div>Cheers,</div><div>Luis </div>"
