     "<div dir=\"auto\"><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"auto\">Hi Jose Luis,</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">I am using a Mac and I am still with an error, it is below:</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:1rem;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:1px;text-decoration:none;font-family:&#39;aptos&#39;,&#39;aptos_embeddedfont&#39;,&#39;aptos_msfontservice&#39;,&#39;calibri&#39;,&#39;helvetica&#39;,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nStarting gl.run.structure </div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:1rem;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:1px;text-decoration:none;font-family:&#39;aptos&#39;,&#39;aptos_embeddedfont&#39;,&#39;aptos_msfontservice&#39;,&#39;calibri&#39;,&#39;helvetica&#39;,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n  Processing genlight object with SNP data</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:1rem;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:1px;text-decoration:none;font-family:&#39;aptos&#39;,&#39;aptos_embeddedfont&#39;,&#39;aptos_msfontservice&#39;,&#39;calibri&#39;,&#39;helvetica&#39;,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nsh: /Users/dani_a55/Desktop/genomics/structure.exe: Permission denied</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:1rem;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:1px;text-decoration:none;font-family:&#39;aptos&#39;,&#39;aptos_embeddedfont&#39;,&#39;aptos_msfontservice&#39;,&#39;calibri&#39;,&#39;helvetica&#39;,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nError in FUN(X[[i]], ...) : </div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:1rem;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:1px;text-decoration:none;font-family:&#39;aptos&#39;,&#39;aptos_embeddedfont&#39;,&#39;aptos_msfontservice&#39;,&#39;calibri&#39;,&#39;helvetica&#39;,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n  Error running STRUCTURE. Error code 126 returned</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">Best,</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">Laia </div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_quote\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Tue, Jul 16, 2024 at 5:32 PM Jose Luis Mijangos &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">luis.m...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\nHi Laia,\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Can you try:</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>- Move your structure executable to a path without spaces and without special characters such as &quot;(&quot; .</div>\r\n<div>- If your computer is a PC running on Windows use: exec = ~/structure.exe , where ~ is the path to your structure executable.</div>\r\n<div>- Make sure that you downloaded the correct executable for your operating system and that is the version without front end.</div>\r\n<div>- After downloading the executable open it (double click) to grant access manually and to make sure it runs.</div>\r\n<div>- Make sure that individual and population names do not have spaces and that they are unique. </div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Please let us know if that worked.</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Cheers,</div>\r\n<div>Luis </div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_quote\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Wednesday 17 July 2024 at 7:19:17 am UTC+10\r\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">laiaju...@gmail.com</a> wrote:<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">\r\nHi everyone,\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">I am having the below error and I would like to have your help. </div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">Thank you,</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">Laia</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:1rem;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:1px;text-decoration:none;font-family:&#39;aptos&#39;,&#39;aptos_embeddedfont&#39;,&#39;aptos_msfontservice&#39;,&#39;calibri&#39;,&#39;helvetica&#39;,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nsetwd(&quot;/Users/dani_a55/Desktop/Report-DTur24-9383 (1)&quot;)</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:1rem;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:1px;text-decoration:none;font-family:&#39;aptos&#39;,&#39;aptos_embeddedfont&#39;,&#39;aptos_msfontservice&#39;,&#39;calibri&#39;,&#39;helvetica&#39;,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n&gt; dolp &lt;- gl.run.structure(gl2, k.range = 2:4, num.k.rep = 10, exec =</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:1rem;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:1px;text-decoration:none;font-family:&#39;aptos&#39;,&#39;aptos_embeddedfont&#39;,&#39;aptos_msfontservice&#39;,&#39;calibri&#39;,&#39;helvetica&#39;,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n+                            &#39;~/Desktop/Report-DTur24-9383 (1)/console/structure&#39;)</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:1rem;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:1px;text-decoration:none;font-family:&#39;aptos&#39;,&#39;aptos_embeddedfont&#39;,&#39;aptos_msfontservice&#39;,&#39;calibri&#39;,&#39;helvetica&#39;,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nStarting gl.run.structure </div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:1rem;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:1px;text-decoration:none;font-family:&#39;aptos&#39;,&#39;aptos_embeddedfont&#39;,&#39;aptos_msfontservice&#39;,&#39;calibri&#39;,&#39;helvetica&#39;,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n  Processing genlight object with SNP data</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:1rem;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:1px;text-decoration:none;font-family:&#39;aptos&#39;,&#39;aptos_embeddedfont&#39;,&#39;aptos_msfontservice&#39;,&#39;calibri&#39;,&#39;helvetica&#39;,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nsh: -c: line 0: syntax error near unexpected token `1&#39;</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:1rem;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:1px;text-decoration:none;font-family:&#39;aptos&#39;,&#39;aptos_embeddedfont&#39;,&#39;aptos_msfontservice&#39;,&#39;calibri&#39;,&#39;helvetica&#39;,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nsh: -c: line 0: `~/Desktop/Report-DTur24-9383 (1)/console/structure -m gtypes.created.on.2024-07-16.14.52.39.structureRun/gtypes.created.on.2024-07-16.14.52.39.structureRun.k2.r1_mainparams -e gtypes.created.on.2024-07-16.14.52.39.structureRun/gtypes.created.on.2024-07-16.14.52.39.structureRun.k2.r1_extraparams\r\n -i gtypes.created.on.2024-07-16.14.52.39.structureRun/gtypes.created.on.2024-07-16.14.52.39.structureRun.k2.r1_data -o gtypes.created.on.2024-07-16.14.52.39.structureRun/gtypes.created.on.2024-07-16.14.52.39.structureRun.k2.r1_out&#39;</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:1rem;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:1px;text-decoration:none;font-family:&#39;aptos&#39;,&#39;aptos_embeddedfont&#39;,&#39;aptos_msfontservice&#39;,&#39;calibri&#39;,&#39;helvetica&#39;,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nError in FUN(X[[i]], ...) : </div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:1rem;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:1px;text-decoration:none;font-family:&#39;aptos&#39;,&#39;aptos_embeddedfont&#39;,&#39;aptos_msfontservice&#39;,&#39;calibri&#39;,&#39;helvetica&#39;,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n  Error running STRUCTURE. Error code 2 returned.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n</div>\r\n<p></p>\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;dartR&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to\r\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">dartr+un...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/dartr/d7d1e093-09b4-4906-97ab-bbcf415457ean%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/dartr/d7d1e093-09b4-4906-97ab-bbcf415457ean%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792457848665000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1TnmAO3A-MhCPCL888sJtf\">\r\nhttps://groups.google.com/d/msgid/dartr/d7d1e093-09b4-4906-97ab-bbcf415457ean%40googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p></p>\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;dartR&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to\r\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">dartr+un...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br></div></blockquote></div>"
